
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Little Taiwan | Travel Guide</title>
<style>
:root {
  --green: #286650;
  --mint: #dcefe3;
  --cream: #fffaf0;
  --orange: #ef9c65;
  --text: #203b32;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--text);
}
header {
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 48px 20px;
}
header h1 { font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem); margin: 10px; }
header p { font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.7; }
nav {
  background: white;
  padding: 15px;
  text-align: center;
  position: sticky;
  top: 0;
  z-index: 2;
}
nav a {
  color: var(--green);
  text-decoration: none;
  font-weight: bold;
  margin: 0 12px;
}
section { max-width: 1100px; margin: auto; padding: 35px 20px; }
h2 { color: var(--green); font-size: 2rem; }
.intro {
  background: var(--mint);
  border-radius: 20px;
  padding: 25px;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
.controls {
  display: flex;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
  gap: 10px;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
input, select, button {
  font: inherit;
  padding: 12px 15px;
  border-radius: 10px;
}
input, select {
  border: 1px solid #c5d8cb;
  background: white;
}
button {
  border: 0;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-weight: bold;
}
button:hover { background: #194b39; }
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
  gap: 18px;
}
.card {
  background: white;
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 14px #244b3215;
}
.card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 160px;
  object-fit: cover;
}
.card-content { padding: 18px; }
.card h3 { color: var(--green); margin-top: 0; }
.card p { line-height: 1.6; }
.region {
  display: inline-block;
  background: var(--mint);
  padding: 5px 9px;
  border-radius: 20px;
  font-size: .8rem;
}
.save {
  background: #f8e8d8;
  color: #754326;
}
.save.saved {
  background: var(--orange);
  color: #352014;
}
#result {
  background: var(--mint);
  padding: 20px;
  border-radius: 15px;
  margin-top: 15px;
  line-height: 1.7;
}
footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px;
  background: var(--green);
  color: white;
  line-height: 1.8;
}
@media(max-width:500px) {
  nav a { display: inline-block; margin: 6px; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <p>✦ SMALL ISLAND, BIG ADVENTURES ✦</p>
  <h1>Little Taiwan 🇹🇼</h1>
  <p>Your pocket travel guide to Taiwan.<br>
  Discover beautiful landscapes, local food, and amazing culture.</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#places">Destinations</a>
  <a href="#counties">22 Cities & Counties</a>
  <a href="#planner">Trip Planner</a>
</nav>

<section id="about">
  <div class="intro">
    <h2>Welcome to Taiwan!</h2>
    Taiwan is a beautiful island with mountains, beaches, lively cities,
    and traditional culture. From delicious night-market snacks to
    breathtaking natural scenery, every place has its own story.
    <br><br>
    This website helps you explore Taiwan and find a destination
    that matches your interests.
  </div>
</section>

<section id="places">
  <h2>Featured Destinations</h2>
  <p>Choose a destination and discover your next adventure!</p>
  <div class="grid" id="featured"></div>
</section>

<section id="counties">
  <h2>Explore All 22 Cities & Counties</h2>
  <p>Search in English or Chinese, or filter places by region.</p>
  <div class="controls">
    <input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Search a city or county..." aria-label="Search cities and counties">
    <select id="region" aria-label="Filter by region">
      <option value="All">All Regions</option>
      <option value="North">Northern Taiwan</option>
      <option value="Central">Central Taiwan</option>
      <option value="South">Southern Taiwan</option>
      <option value="East">Eastern Taiwan</option>
      <option value="Islands">Outlying Islands</option>
    </select>
  </div>
  <p id="count"></p>
  <div class="grid" id="countyGrid"></div>
</section>

<section id="planner">
  <h2>Plan Your Little Escape ✨</h2>
  <p>What kind of trip are you looking for today?</p>
  <div class="controls">
    <select id="mood">
      <option value="nature">I love nature and mountains</option>
      <option value="food">I want local food and culture</option>
      <option value="beach">I want sunshine and beaches</option>
      <option value="city">I want to explore a city</option>
    </select>
    <button id="plan">Find My Destination</button>
    <button id="random">Surprise Me!</button>
  </div>
  <div id="result" aria-live="polite">
    Your next adventure is waiting. Choose your travel mood!
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  <strong>Little Taiwan | Your Island Adventure</strong><br>
  Travel gently. Discover more. Make wonderful memories.<br>
  Made with love for Taiwan 🇹🇼
</footer>

